*.dcm

# COCA is redistributable by nobody but Stanford: its Research Use Agreement
# forbids publishing "any portion" of the Dataset, and its dataset page
# describes the expert scores as part of the Dataset rather than a derivative.
# Nothing COCA-derived belongs in this repository.
*coca*.csv
*COCA*.csv

